8 0 obj
<< /Length 445 >>
stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 72 740 Td
(The V-model) '
() '
(The V-model structures development: requirements and design on the left side,) '
(implementation at the bottom, and verification and validation on the right side, where) '
(each test level checks the matching design level. Unit tests check the software units,) '
(integration tests check how components work together, and vehicle-level validation checks) '
(that the safety goals are met.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
